WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.910
Add an i18n block to next.config.js,

2
00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:08.903
and Next.js serves each
language at its own URL.

3
00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:13.586
General Translation's gt-next
then renders and translates copy

4
00:00:13.586 --> 00:00:15.477
written inline in JSX.

5
00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:20.957
Next.js also redirects by browser
language and passes the locale

6
00:00:20.957 --> 00:00:24.196
to getStaticProps,
but renders no text.

7
00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:29.445
Wrap next.config.ts
with withGTConfig,

8
00:00:29.445 --> 00:00:32.416
and keep the i18n block for routing.

9
00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:39.977
Wrap each page's data function with
withGTStaticProps or withGTServerSideProps,

10
00:00:39.977 --> 00:00:42.089
and mark copy with the T component.

11
00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:46.422
Then run npx gt translate
before next build.

12
00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:49.634
Your team now ships
Spanish with each release.
